## Lookup argument

| argument | behavior |
|---|---|
| `key` | Required. The registry setting key to read. Must exist in the backend registry — an unknown key returns an error. |

## Returned values

| attribute | description |
|---|---|
| `key` | The setting key. |
| `value` | Current value using its native Terraform type (sensitive). **Masked as `****` for secret keys.** |
| `description` | Human-readable description from the registry. |
| `is_secret` | Whether the value is a secret (masked in responses). |
| `default` | Registry default value using its native Terraform type. Masked as `****` for non-empty secret keys. |
| `created_at` | Creation timestamp. |
| `updated_at` | Last update timestamp. |

## Valid `key` values

The following table is derived from the MisterShell 2.0.7 registry. Unknown keys
return 404. Defaults below are registry defaults, not the instance's current
values. The session inactivity timeout accepts 1–240 minutes; backend upgrades
clamp larger stored values to 240.

